    {
      "id": "ledger-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "The cell the previous lane could not reach: size 11 exceeded ten minutes monolithically and was left at S(6) >= 11. The prefix/suffix reduction closed it -- fixing a prefix and encoding only the suffix against the prefix's output set took the refutation from 1195s to 151s. This is validation, not a frontier result: S(n) for optimal SIZE is settled through n = 12 (Harder 2020, arXiv:2012.04400, Isabelle/HOL-verified), and the smallest genuinely open cell is S(13).",
        "type": "prose"
